{
 "id": "story-daniel-i-lovehulen-soul",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/story-daniel-i-lovehulen-soul",
 "offset_seconds": -3.6200000000001786,
 "words_heard": 263,
 "words": 271,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They searched his life for something wrong, but not a fault was there to see",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So they went to King Darius with a ban and a decree",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For thirty days, no prayer to any god or man but you",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the law of Medes and Persians says that no one can undo",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When Daniel learned the ban was signed, he went home and climbed the stair",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To the upper room with windows open toward Jerusalem in prayer",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three times a day he got down on his knees",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Giving thanks to his God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just as he had always done",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three times a day, three times a day",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They threw him in the lions' den, a stone was laid upon the door",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The king sealed it with his signet ring, and he could do no more",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He went back to his palace and he fasted through the night",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And sleep fled from him, till he ran to the den at first light",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Daniel, servant of the living God, the king cried out in fear",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Has the God you serve continually been able to save you here",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Daniel called, O king, live forever, no harm has come to me",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They lifted him out of the den, and not a wound was there to see",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My God sent his angel and shut the mouths of the lions",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He rescues and he saves",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He is the living God, enduring forever",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three times a day he got down on his knees",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Giving thanks to his God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just as he had always done",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three times a day, three times a day",
